{"overview":"Esther Blodgett is just another starry-eyed farm kid trying to break into the movies. Waitressing at a Hollywood party, she catches the eye of her idol Norman Maine, is sent for a screen test, and before long attains stardom as newly minted Vicki Lester. She and Norman marry, though his career soon dwindles to nothing due to his chronic alcoholism.","tagline":"Is the price of stardom a broken heart?","cast":[{"n":"Janet Gaynor","c":"Esther Blodgett","p":"/xaiUwIObrSnFlNsqKrxJ10ZVMfw.jpg","q":"Q182462"},{"n":"Fredric March","c":"Norman Maine","p":"/285cjPToJMXn0ALimtQoqofgM2G.jpg","q":"Q181819"},{"n":"Adolphe Menjou","c":"Oliver Niles","p":"/88FfjxT3cFDIbCIK0UmwyjEF6tU.jpg","q":"Q358379"},{"n":"May Robson","c":"Lettie Blodgett","p":"/h4o6NoaGRoFvY8vo7YfbZtZvRtg.jpg","q":"Q259600"},{"n":"Andy Devine","c":"Danny McGuire","p":"/rBCv7cszfbo2dkQbGxxff9xTppL.jpg","q":"Q386105"},{"n":"Lionel Stander","c":"Matt Libby","p":"/AatXdvOQx9BEGSqHqL2eeoTNvCb.jpg","q":"Q589753"},{"n":"Owen Moore","c":"Casey Burke","p":"/6iBzyALpUaf22lKD2kRgzmsHGuC.jpg","q":"Q966972"},{"n":"Peggy Wood","c":"Miss Phillips","p":"/n6vfEUjEF5lFeTcEyaFPChO2EQl.jpg","q":"Q266445"},{"n":"Elizabeth Jenns","c":"Anita Regis","p":"/qTOSYKwQmlK2WRML7gPwmgIaKMo.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Edgar Kennedy","c":"Pop Randall","p":"/oA8h7AdAUZYg5uO0xzFMQOkc9DQ.jpg","q":"Q714724"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Star_Is_Born_%281937_film%29","qid":"Q873186","rel":{"CA":{"d":"1937-04-27","c":"PG"},"DE":{"d":"1982-10-31"},"ES":{"d":"1937-04-20","c":"7"},"GB":{"d":"1939-12-17","c":"12"},"JP":{"d":"1939-04-03","c":"PG12"},"US":{"d":"1937-04-20","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/pMnXtyGFUrCRH7tVGIkkrGHs3AX.jpg","/luK4dWPjFIJDMv2LAGpshjNK08.jpg","/amP6pv1COxZuXFY6JT4aau0ziew.jpg","/jAnHmUtfwKXjqLg1POC7Lod9U1K.jpg","/etym5VtdQ7VNW9ei5kBjNMaIADx.jpg","/kCraBjxriz4Fva0ujU7G8y1tO1q.jpg","/qDhKE22EvC8utQJOjzriGTxLxSS.jpg","/kwz3PMWn6JFEths6ay1lkavVbvh.jpg"]}